        {
            "block_label": "display_formula",
            "block_content": " $$ Mn = -0.013 + 0.852Mn_{III} + +0.006CaCO_{3} - 0.002FeO; \\quad (II.9) \\\\\nS = -0.088 + 1.349S_{III} - 0.018CaCO_{3} + +0.003FeO \\quad (II.10) \\\\\n(при непрерывном выпуске шлака); \\\\\nS = 0.051 + 0.444S_{III} - 0.008CaCO_{3} + +0.003FeO \\quad (II.11) $$ ",
